    fix(tests): poll pidfile instead of single existsSync in pidfile-isolation AC3 (INT-CI-021)
    
    Run 37541016412 raced: /health answered before the daemon's pidfile write
    landed, so expect(fs.existsSync(pid2)) failed on a boot race. AC3 now uses
    a bounded 50ms poll with the daemon-ready budget as its deadline; a genuine
    never-written pidfile still fails with a named reason.
    
